WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Inside the lit machine, packaged meals sit on the shelves.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.500
The ordering screen is shown above the
card reader and collection compartment.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.000
The collection compartment opens.
A packaged meal slides out.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.150
The illuminated compartment presents the meal for collection.
